Ascension @PROJECT_VERSION@
LitRPG vertical slice (data preview)

Run the Ascension executable in this folder. It reads data/*.json from beside
itself and draws the Fighter's stats with placeholder rectangles and text.

Edit those JSON files while the program is running. After the file has finished
saving, the screen picks up the new stats (it waits until the write settles, so
a half-saved file is left alone). A file that no longer loads keeps the previous
data on screen and shows the error.

This build is the project skeleton: definitions for stats, skills, classes,
enemies and gear. Combat is not in yet.
